      <chord name="C"/>Jesus loves me! This I know, <chord name="F"/>For the Bible <chord name="C"/>tells me <chord name="G"/>so;<br/>
      <chord name="C"/>Little ones to Him belong, <chord name="F"/>They are <chord name="C"/>weak but <chord name="G"/>He is <chord name="C"/>strong.<br/>
      <chord name="C"/>Yes, Jesus <chord name="F"/>loves me! <chord name="C"/>Yes, Jesus <chord name="G"/>loves me!<br/>
      <chord name="C"/>Yes, Jesus <chord name="F"/>loves me! The <chord name="C"/>Bible <chord name="G"/>tells me <chord name="C"/>so.
      </lines>
    </verse>
    <verse name="c1">
      <lines>
      <chord name="C"/>Yes, <chord name="F"/>Jesus <chord name="C"/>loves <chord name="G"/>me!<br/>
