      </lines>
    </verse>
    <verse name="v3">
      <lines>
      <chord name="C"/>Jesus, <chord name="F"/>take this <chord name="C"/>heart <chord name="G"/>of mine,<br/>
      <chord name="C"/>Make <chord name="F"/>it <chord name="C"/>pure <chord name="G"/>and <chord name="C"/>wholly thine;<br/>
      <chord name="C"/>On <chord name="F"/>the coross <chord name="C"/>You died <chord name="G"/>for me,<br/>
